 safety.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"Owned hazelnut sample. Required instruments, reagents, reference materials and other prerequisites are unknown; specify them before any physical trial.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Unknown. Specify study time, execution time, energy, sample consumption and hazards. Do not consume the sample or start a hazardous trial merely to register the procedure.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"A bounded, evidence-producing assessment method if physically supported, or an explicit account of what cannot currently be established. No assumed safety, nutrition, successful preparation or health benefit.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Retain one berry as a reserve after the planned meal.\\\",\\\"Learning fire handling established mastery, not a lit fire or food preparation outcome.\\\",\\\"Evaluate any proposed assessment contract before acquiring materials or conducting a trial.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

